  "evidencia": "Page: Johnston Forbes-Robertson. Sentence: He was considered the finest Hamlet of the Victorian era and one of the finest actors of his time, despite his dislike of the job and his lifelong belief that he was temperamentally unsuited to acting.\nPage: Prince Hamlet. Sentence: He is the Prince of Denmark, nephew to the usurping Claudius, and son of King Hamlet, the previous King of Denmark.\nPage: Gertrude Elliott. Sentence: Gertrude Elliott (December 14, 1874 — December 24, 1950), later Lady Forbes-Robertson, was an American stage actress, part of an extended family of theatre professionals including her husband Johnston Forbes-Robertson and her sister Maxine Elliott.",
